# Raw Data

This folder contains the original Zomato Delivery Operations dataset used for the logistics analytics project.

## Purpose

The raw dataset serves as the primary source of information for analysis and should remain unchanged throughout the project. All cleaning, preprocessing, and transformations are performed on copies of this data.

## Dataset

### zomato_delivery.csv

The dataset contains information related to food delivery operations, including:

- Order details
- Delivery partner information
- Delivery times
- Delivery distances
- Traffic conditions
- Weather conditions
- Vehicle types
- Delivery status

## Important Note

- Do not modify the files in this folder.
- Always keep an untouched copy of the original dataset.
- Any cleaned or transformed datasets should be stored in the `data/processed/` folder.

## Usage

The dataset is used for:

1. Data Cleaning and Preprocessing
2. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
3. KPI Calculation
4. Feature Engineering
5. Predictive Modeling
6. Logistics Performance Evaluation

## Data Source

Source: Zomato Delivery Operations Dataset (Kaggle/Public Dataset)

This dataset is used solely for educational and analytical purposes as part of the Zomato Delivery Analytics Project.
